LPL phou description

specification description 
   part Btypes	of sort list[identifier]
		modules sigSyntax
   part Mvars	of sort list[vardef]
		modules sigSyntax ivars[Btypes]
   part Bvars	of sort list[vardef]
		modules sigSyntax ivars[Btypes]
end    
query		of sort  input
		result of sort list[uconj]
		modules phounif[Mvars,Btypes,Bvars]
		start with (Protheo)phou(query)
end of LPL description




